      "lines": [
        "**第五章提要**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "*自然界中所有已知的力，都是几种相互作用形式的表现.",
        "在力学中所讨论的力，总共是两种相互作用形式（电磁的和引",
        "力的）的表现.*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "*弹性力和摩擦力是电磁相互作用的表现.*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
